              "key": "Optional",
              "docs": "**int**: Manually specify the I\u00b2C address of the sensor. Defaults to `0x6B`.\n\n*See also: [SEN6x Series Environmental Sensor](https://esphome.io/components/sensor/sen6x#configuration-variables)*"
            },
            "co2": {
              "key": "Optional",
              "schema": {
